    s=json.loads((PUBLIC/'summary.json').read_text());lines=[];add=lambda x='':lines.append(x)
    add('# H3ai: occupied-pair certificates improve complete compilation');add();add(f"**Both fixed N15 models support the prospective ≥1.25× full-compilation speed target.** The measured ratios are {s['families'][0]['speed_ratio']:.6f}× for zebra and {s['families'][1]['speed_ratio']:.6f}× for the (2,5) leaper, after the complete shared build/parity/monitor cost is charged to both arms. Complete model and cache files are byte-identical. This is one paired point timing per family, not a runtime confidence interval.");add();add('![Complete compilation integration](../../../../results/research/loki/h3ai/full-compiler-integration.png)');add();add('| Family | BP AdamW compilation method | Full per-arm compile (s) | Shared cost charged (s) | Full charged denominator (s) | Certificate component (s) | Complete states |');add('|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|')
